    <Name>(patch) Vox Populi Mod Compatibility</Name>
    <Teaser>Balances the following mods in the description for the Vox Populi.</Teaser>
    <Description>Download the Vox Populi here: [NEWLINE]http://forums.civfanatics.com/showthread.php?t=528034
[NEWLINE]
[NEWLINE]This mod is a componental mod.
[NEWLINE]Use the CompatibilityOptions.sql to change the component options.
[NEWLINE]
[NEWLINE]
[NEWLINE]Forked version made for VP 2.0 with additional mod compatibility made by N.Core.</Description>
    <Authors>Techpriest Enginseer, N.Core</Authors>
    <SpecialThanks>thecrazyscotsman, framedarchitecture</SpecialThanks>
